# Agent instructions stay OUT of every repo under energy-solution. They are
# workspace- and machine-specific context, not part of the product: they name
# local paths, the SMB share, and how this particular box is set up, none of
# which is true for anyone who clones this. The workspace copy lives one level
# up, outside any repo.
CLAUDE.md
